<tr><th style="padding:10px 12px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; font-size:15px; background:#F7F8FA; color:#191F28; text-align:left; font-weight:700; vertical-align:top; width:34%;">구성</th><td style="padding:10px 12px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; font-size:15px; text-align:left; background:#FFFFFF; color:#191F28; vertical-align:top;">DJI Terra Flagship + DJI Modify Flagship</td></tr>
<tr><th style="padding:10px 12px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; font-size:15px; background:#F7F8FA; color:#191F28; text-align:left; font-weight:700; vertical-align:top; width:34%;">사용 기간</th><td style="padding:10px 12px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; font-size:15px; text-align:left; background:#FFFFFF; color:#191F28; vertical-align:top;">1년 (DJI 운영표 품명)</td></tr>
<tr><th style="padding:10px 12px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; font-size:15px; background:#F7F8FA; color:#191F28; text-align:left; font-weight:700; vertical-align:top; width:34%;">시스템 요구 사항</th><td style="padding:10px 12px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; font-size:15px; text-align:left; background:#FFFFFF; color:#191F28; vertical-align:top;">Windows 10 이상(64비트) · RAM 32GB · GPU 메모리 4GB 이상, 연산 능력 6.1 이상 NVIDIA 그래픽 카드</td></tr>
